2026-07-16 18:25:24,716 [INFO] [VERIFY-REJECT] 刘世刚: REJECT: Scope of control violation — Liu Shigang directly asks “六点零八——你等谁？”, which is permissible, but frames it with *interpretive certainty*: “你爸懂火候，你也该懂.” This presumes刘铭’s capacity, identity, or obligation (“should” implies normative expectation beyond observation), crossing into internal attribution. More critically, “直直看向刘铭睫毛上那点水汽” treats刘铭’s physiological response (water vapor on lashes) as objectively legible *and* interpretable by Liu Shigang — implying access to刘铭’s embodied state without sensory justification (steam is ambient; individual lash moisture isn’t discernible at arm’s length). This violates cognitive boundary + scope of control.
